&lt;li&gt;Regulatory Advice and Licensing: Provide practical and commercially focused recommendations concerning financial services regulation within the UK, EU, and other international regions, including licensing and regulatory engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Governance: Assist with corporate governance matters and other general legal issues as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trading and Capital Markets: Deliver outstanding legal assistance across key capital markets functions, encompassing prime brokerage, execution platforms, and traded products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Services and Digital Assets: Provide legal support for various financial services and digital asset activities, including cross-border payments, stablecoin issuance, and custodial solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
