&lt;li&gt;Serve as an advisor/Ripple advocate with customers, enabling them to better experience the potential of Ripple and participate in developing new and ground-breaking solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct financial, business and value analysis with the ability to understand and analyze key financial targets (e.g., cost reduction, revenue growth, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate upsell and cross sell opportunities and drive them to deal execution, working with cross functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
