&lt;p&gt;Ripple Treasury, now a Ripple solution, was acquired by Ripple in 2025, marking a significant expansion into the multi-trillion-dollar corporate finance arena.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple Treasury has more than 40 years of experience supporting some of the world’s largest and most sophisticated companies. Integrating its treasury command center into Ripple’s technology stack gives corporates the ability to move, manage and optimize liquidity in real-time, across traditional and digital assets, under one expanded umbrella.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us to build the future of corporate treasury and the infrastructure that powers the Internet of Value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Developer, you will build and own the platform powering financial clarity for businesses from SMEs to Fortune 500 enterprises. You will own full-stack feature delivery across front-end, server-side, and database tiers — leveraging Azure to craft scalable, resilient cloud solutions at the core of a fast-growing SaaS product. You will shape technical direction and mentor fellow engineers within a you-build-it-you-run-it team that holds itself to the highest standards. If you are energized by complex distributed systems and want to make a measurable impact on how the world manages its finances, this is the opportunity for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with architects and product managers to design, estimate, and deliver cutting-edge features across the full stack — front-end, server-side, and database tiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Leverage Azure services to build powerful, scalable, and resilient cloud-native solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Improve software applications and own delivery pipelines and feature flags, ensuring seamless integration and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive rigorous unit, integration, and non-functional testing — including performance and security — to guarantee production-ready software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Use observability tools and logging to diagnose and resolve issues across development, test, and production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Stay ahead of tech trends, engage with the broader tech community, mentor fellow engineers, and lead technical design and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Continuously improve team operations, processes, methodologies, and technology choices, holding every practice to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure all work meets quality, operational, and architectural standards, contributing to the organization&#39;s broader success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Embrace the team&#39;s YBIYRI (you-build-it-you-run-it) model, including active participation in the on-call pager rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
