&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver roadmaps, driving technical and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor team members for professional and technical growth, while providing hands-on leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and encourage engineering standard processes, collaborating with partners across Ripple and in the XRPL community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement agile processes for innovation and incremental objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical concepts for various audiences including engineers, business and technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the team by attracting and mentoring leaders and engineers of varying experience levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit outstanding engineers, in collaboration with Ripple’s recruiting team.&lt;/li&gt;
