&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with event-driven micro-services, Kubernetes, and cloud-based infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with React&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with gRPC and protocol buffers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced start-up environment and be a core contributor to the success of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter that thrives on autonomy and can see a task through from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive attitude with a passion for acquiring and sharing knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
