&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Cash Forecasting team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cash Forecasting&lt;/strong&gt; is our AI-amplified treasury solution that helps CFOs and treasury teams move beyond error-prone spreadsheets to achieve real-time cash visibility and predictive accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform integrates seamlessly with major ERPs and banking systems to automatically capture, categorize, and analyze transactional data across multiple currencies and business units. Leveraging our proprietary GSmart AI technology, the solution continuously learns from historical cash flows, sales data, and treasury information to automatically select optimal forecasting algorithms and improve accuracy by over 30%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on sophisticated machine learning models, automated variance analysis, real-time data orchestration from diverse financial sources, and intuitive dashboards that allow users to drill down from high-level summaries to individual transaction details. This is a critical platform managing over $100 billion in daily cash flow for enterprise customers across 40+ countries, with the technical challenge of delivering rapid 90-day implementations while maintaining enterprise-grade security and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
